   {
    "claim": "On scene 0cf6368d, the one failure (lead shifted -1 s, recorded speed, 250 ms delay) was not a rear-end of the lead car. The ego turned left out of its lane on a LEFT command and clipped a different vehicle stopped in the next lane. The policy was at fault, but the delay was above the 200 ms cap and the other repeats at this setting passed.",
    "settings": [
     "S11"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "No setting failed on scenes 023b7fcc, 096988dd, 09a95ffa, 0dbb91dd, 12855a41 or 19f339ba, even with planner delays up to 400 ms. The settings repeated several times (S2, S6, S7) passed every run, and their ranges are below 0.5.",
